</span> <b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইয়ের</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">প্রধান</span> </b><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">তথ্য</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ধরণ</span>: <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ভাষা</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">শিক্ষা</span> (Spoken English)<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Publication:\r\n     <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">উল্লেখ</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">নেই</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিশেষত্ব</span>: <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">সহজভাবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ইংরেজি</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বলার</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">কৌশল</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">শেখানো</span><o:p></o:p></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\",sans-serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Segoe UI Emoji\"\">📌</span> <b><span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বিষয়বস্তু</span></b><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এই</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বইতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">দৈনন্দিন</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">জীবনে</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ব্যবহারযোগ্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">ইংরেজি</span> <span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">বাক্য</span>, grammar-<span style=\"font-family:\"Nirmala UI\",sans-serif\">এর</span> <span style=\"font